    { "id": "batch1-brief", "x": 0, "y": -240, "w": 560, "page": "page-1", "text": "THE MARLOW PAPERS — a city that runs on paper.\nBrand-new direction, nothing like previous work: ivory stock on a dark desk, ink type (Instrument Serif + Archivo + Plex Mono), vermilion stamps, punched tickets, ledger rules, crop marks. Cards deal in, stamps slam, meters draw. Identity is a placeholder." },
